--- body ---
## Context
Author decision, 2026-11-01, amended the same day: Albert serves the whole
RAG, i.e. embeddings, retrieval and generation, not only the models behind
R2R. Consider whether Albert's RAG endpoint can also run locally for speed.

Today the production R2R config (deploy/user_configs/cidir2r.toml) sets no LLM
or embedding provider, so R2R uses its OpenAI defaults; the frontend calls
R2R's /v3/retrieval/rag directly (src/frontend/query-processor.js:100) and the
model list lives in src/frontend/settings.js. Keeping data and queries on
sovereign infrastructure also answers part of ticket 0001 (provider transfer
in the privacy notice) and moves the spending risk of ticket 0004 off the
OpenAI bill.

To verify, not assumed: that Albert exposes document collections, search and
RAG-style chat endpoints usable as a full replacement for R2R, and that its
API stack is open source and self-hostable (models on a local GPU host such as
padme) with acceptable latency.

## Imagine first
This changes the architecture, so it starts with a design note
(conception/design-note-template.md in the harness: problem, situation from
git, state of the art, alternatives, synthesis with costs, phased plan, double
advisor review + KISS). Alternatives to compare at least:
- A. Albert end to end (collections + search + generation) replacing R2R;
- B. Albert models (embeddings + generation) behind R2R, R2R keeping retrieval;
- C. A self-hosted Albert stack on a local GPU host, for latency, with the
  public Albert service as fallback.
Measure on a fixed question set: answer quality with citations, latency
(first token and full answer), cost, and operational load (what the solo
maintainer must run and patch).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Design note written with the three alternatives measured and a recommendation the author accepts
- [ ] Chosen option deployed: embeddings, retrieval and generation all served as decided; keys and endpoints only in the untracked deploy env
- [ ] Corpus re-ingested once under the new embeddings, together with ticket 0011
- [ ] Frontend model list, cost estimator and privacy notice match what is served
- [ ] Smoke test answers a known question with citations through the new path; quality compared with the OpenAI/R2R baseline
